  "content": "<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/EHOCKO5PQA0?si=rn-7Wo9JYHF6OeSx\" width=\"860\" height=\"515\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>Immersive Damage Indicators 加入了浮動動畫文字，每當你對生物造成傷害時就會顯示，並透過 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-messages-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Messages API</a> 支援自訂字體、動畫與顏色效果。</p><p>此模組是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmm-indicators\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mmm Indicators</a> 的多重載入器更新分支，其渲染系統已完全改用 Immersive Messages，以支援自訂效果與動畫。</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1255453/description_de7bc381-5299-43bd-8112-ba5ca9ec1247.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/nRQKp3Thsz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Luna Pixel&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=0843bf&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kS7auUeYmc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/901654795100749884?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Txni&amp;labelColor=36633c&amp;color=393939\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/txnimc/ImmersiveDamageIndicators\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Github&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=666666&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"!<a href=\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/txni/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=fb594a&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=CurseForge&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"!<a href=\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTxni\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=33de61&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"!<a href=\"></a></strong></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1255453/description_633a8279-1d3a-4ed7-a349-3783b1317447.png\"></p><p>若想使用自訂字體，需安裝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcaxton\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caxton</a>。不過，啟用 Iris 光影時自訂字體無法運作，屆時此模組會自動退回使用原版文字渲染器。</p><p>若已安裝 Caxton，此模組預設會自動使用 Anton 字體，您可以在設定檔中變更字體，或留空以停用此功能：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1255453/description_1e0496b4-acd7-4daf-a574-ed4261ad49b3.png\"></p><p>您也可以設定自訂顏色、將紅色受傷顏色改為其他顏色，並逐一關閉每項效果。</p><p>若您是開發者，亦可使用提供的事件來完全存取粒子實例與 ImmersiveMessage 物件，以進行自訂樣式設定：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1255453/description_b237606e-6533-4636-a305-bc78a1dc29cf.png\"></p>",
